        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I think it would be totally fine if the cursors were merged / if any cursor that would be taken beyond the position of the next cursor or the EOF would be effectively deleted.\nThe same problems come up for any kind of motion that transports individual cursors by different amounts. Even word/Word motions will do that.\nMerging is the cleanest solution in my opinion.",
